<title>UK: TABLE-Birmingham Midshires H1 pretax up 1.2 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Birmingham Midshires H1 pretax up 1.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Interest income	  64.2		   vs 67.0</p>
<p> Total income	     84.1		   vs 84.7</p>
<p> Loss provisions	  4.8		    vs 1.8</p>
<p> Pretax		     34.0		   vs 33.6</p>
<p> Pretax before provs    38.8		   vs 35.4</p>
<p> Total assets	     7,007.9		vs 6,805.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the British building society is Birmingham Midshires.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
